<%# ============ RBAC 权限模型 ============ %>
<section id="rbac" class="bg-ink-100/60 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">RBAC 权限模型</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700">五表为骨、ActionPolicy 为魂；最小授权单元是「权限点」，而非角色。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">数据模型（6 张核心表）</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink-700">
          <li><span class="font-medium text-ink-900">users</span> — 用户；<code>belongs_to :department</code>，<code>has_many :roles through :user_roles</code></li>
          <li><span class="font-medium text-ink-900">roles</span> — 角色；<code>has_many :permissions through :role_permissions</code></li>
          <li><span class="font-medium text-ink-900">permissions</span> — 权限点（最小授权单元）</li>
          <li><span class="font-medium text-ink-900">role_permissions</span> — 角色↔权限连接表</li>
          <li><span class="font-medium text-ink-900">user_roles</span> — 用户↔角色连接表</li>
          <li><span class="font-medium text-ink-900">menus</span> — 菜单（自引用树 <code>parent/children</code>）</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-700">三层边界：L1 资源/权限点定义 → L2 角色授权（纯配置）→ L3 用户-角色分配（纯配置）。<span class="text-accent">super_admin</span> 为 user 表布尔标记，<code>ApplicationPolicy</code> 基类短路放行。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">授权范式（ActionPolicy）</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-700">控制器只问「能否做」，policy 永远判权限点码，绝不硬编码角色：</p>
        <pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded bg-ink-900 p-3 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-100"><code># 控制器
authorize! User, to: :create?
scope = policy_scope(User)

# policy
class UserPolicy &lt; ApplicationPolicy
  def create?
    user.has_permission?("system:user:add")
  end
end</code></pre>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-700">数据权限引擎 <code>ApplicationPolicy#scope_for</code>：超管直通；普通按 <code>user.data_scope</code> 过滤含 <code>department_id</code> 的资源；<code>dept_and_child</code> 子树用逗号边界精确匹配（禁 <code>'%id%'</code> 模糊，防跨部门越权）。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ============ 设计系统 ============ %>
<section id="design" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">统一设计系统</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700">黛青为脉、赭石为印、墨色为骨；前后台令牌单向对齐，皮相端庄自有章法。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm">
      <span class="h-8 w-8 rounded-md bg-primary"></span>
      <div><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">黛青 · 主色</div><div class="text-xs text-ink-500">#1B6E78</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm">
      <span class="h-8 w-8 rounded-md bg-accent"></span>
      <div><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">赭石 · 强调</div><div class="text-xs text-ink-500">#BF8430</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm">
      <span class="h-8 w-8 rounded-md bg-ink-900"></span>
      <div><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">墨色 · 中性灰阶</div><div class="text-xs text-ink-500">#162024 → #f6f8f8</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink-700">单一真相：前台令牌在 <code>app/assets/tailwind/application.css</code> 的 <code>@theme {}</code>；后台在 <code>app/frontend/styles/tokens.ts</code>，经 antd <code>ConfigProvider</code> 对接。圆角统一 6px（<code>rounded-md</code>）。antd v6 用法：<code>Card</code> 用 <code>variant</code> 不用 <code>bordered</code>；<code>Modal/Drawer</code> 用 <code>destroyOnHidden</code>；<code>message/modal</code> 用 <code>App.useApp()</code>。</p>
</section>

<%# ============ 使用说明 ============ %>
<section id="usage" class="bg-ink-100/60 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">使用说明</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700">从装环境到新增一个后台模块的标准姿势。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">安装与开发</h3>
        <pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded bg-ink-900 p-3 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-100"><code># 环境：Ruby 4.0+ · Node 22+ · SQLite
bundle install
npm install
bin/rails db:create db:migrate db:seed
bin/dev            # Rails + Vite + Tailwind 同起

# 前台 http://localhost:3000 （root）
# 后台 http://localhost:3000/admin（登录）</code></pre>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-700">种子账号：<code>admin / 13800000000 / admin123456</code>（用户名 / 手机 / 邮箱 + 密码均可登录）。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">测试把关</h3>
        <pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded bg-ink-900 p-3 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-100"><code># 后端：minitest
bin/rails test

# 前端：类型检查 + 生产构建
npm run check
RAILS_ENV=production bin/vite build</code></pre>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-700">后台 Inertia 页渲染依赖 Vite 资产；CI 须以生产构建产物喂测试环境，避免 test 环境自动构建触发批量删除护栏。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-ink-100 bg-white p-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">新增后台模块标准流程（以「公告 announcements」为例）</h3>
      <ol class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink-700">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-xs font-bold text-white">1</span> 建迁移 + 模型（含 <code>department_id</code> 等数据权限所需列）。</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span> 建 <code>Admin::AnnouncementsController &lt; Admin::BaseController</code>：<code>authorize!</code> + <code>policy_scope</code>；写路径收裸 params（前端 ProListPage 发裸值）；成功 redirect、失败 422 + errors。</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-xs font-bold text-white">3</span> 建 <code>AnnouncementPolicy &lt; ApplicationPolicy</code>，永远用权限点码（如 <code>system:announcement:list</code>）判 <code>user.has_permission?</code>。</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-xs font-bold text-white">4</span> <code>config/routes.rb</code> 后台命名空间内加 <code>resources :announcements, only: [:index, :create, :update, :destroy]</code>。</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-xs font-bold text-white">5</span> 建 <code>app/frontend/pages/admin/announcements/index.tsx</code>，用 <code>ProListPage</code> 封装（<code>data</code> 来自 Inertia props）。</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-xs font-bold text-white">6</span> seed 权限点码 + 菜单项（连 <code>menus</code> 表），保证角色可授权、侧栏可见。</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-8">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-700">系统内置模块（已落地）</h3>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink-700">
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-primary">✓</span> <strong>文件管理</strong>（本地磁盘 Active Storage）：后台「系统管理 → 文件管理」。上传（Inertia 多部件）/ 列表 / 预览 / 下载 / 删除；权限点 <code>system:file:list / upload / delete</code>，超管短路放行，操作日志自动记录。</li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-primary">✓</span> 服务监控（Solid Queue / Cache / Cable 总览 + 应用指标）、定时任务、在线用户、操作 / 登录双日志等，见后台「系统监控」目录。</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 rounded bg-ink-50 p-3 text-sm text-ink-600">文件本体存于 <code>storage/</code>（dev/prod 均用 <code>:local</code> 磁盘后端），元数据经 Active Storage blob 重定向 URL 提供预览 / 下载。</p>
  </div>
</section>

